<title>RUSSIA: Aeroflot begins Moscow-Mauritius route.</title>
<headline>Aeroflot begins Moscow-Mauritius route.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Aeroflot International Airlines will launch a regular service between Moscow and Mauritius in South Eastern Africa from November 1, a company spokeswoman said on Monday.</p>
<p>Yuliya Maryashkina said Aeroflot would make regular flights on Fridays operating Tupolev-154 jets with two classes of service.</p>
<p>&quot;During the 12 hour flight the plane will make stopovers in Dubai and the Seychelles,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>--Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
